      "description": "Watch Al Qadsia vs Al Faisaly FC highlights and goals from Pro League - Saudi Arabia on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 30, 2026. The clash between Al Qadsia and Al Faisaly FC stood as a highly anticipated fixture in the Pro League calendar. Taking place on August 30, 2026, the match delivered a compelling narrative defined by quick transitions, clinical finishing, and the cruel reality of individual errors. A Blistering Start for the Hosts The home side wasted no time establishing dominance. Just 5 minutes into the game, Mateo Retegui found the back of the net after a perfectly weighted assist from Musab Al-Juwayr . The momentum remained firmly with the hosts, and in the 12th minute, Abdoulaye Seck doubled the lead, converting a setup from Andrei Girotto . While Mohammed Al Shanqiti picked up an early yellow card, the intensity remained high until Mohammed Abu Al Shamat pulled one back for Al Faisaly FC in the 30th minute, injecting fresh life into the visitors' campaign. Second Half Decisiveness As the second half commenced, both teams ramped up the physical stakes. The turning point occurred in the 56th minute when an own goal by Al Faisaly FC swung the scoreboard back in favor of a comfortable home lead. Despite tactical adjustments and substitutions throughout the latter stages, the deficit proved insurmountable for the visitors. The referee issued several cautions, including yellow cards for Alexandre Mendy and Jaime Seoane , as the game grew increasingly disjointed in the final quarter. Following six minutes of added time, the whistle confirmed that the three points would remain at home."
